{"id":"3b64f1a3878ce6ee","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/916_Deep_Inference_SKS.md","title":"916 Deep Inference SKS","display":"916_Deep_Inference_SKS","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"916-Deep-Inference-SKS\">916 Deep Inference SKS</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}=\\{a_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}=\\{a_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。结构构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{coatom},\\operatorname{tt},\\operatorname{ff},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{coatom},\\operatorname{tt},\\operatorname{ff},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{coatom},\\operatorname{tt},\\operatorname{ff},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{coatom},\\operatorname{tt},\\operatorname{ff},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}\\)</span> 六个构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{coatom}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tt},\\operatorname{ff}\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{coatom}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tt},\\operatorname{ff}\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>SKS 的目标特征是规则可在任意深上下文中重写结构，而不是只作用于公式根部。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-结构、对偶、自由原子与替换\">2. 结构、对偶、自由原子与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atom}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atom}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coatom}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coatom}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tt}\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tt}\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ff}\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ff}\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R,S\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(R,S)\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R,S\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(R,S)\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R,S\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(R,S)\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R,S\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(R,S)\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-)^\\perp:\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\">\\((-)^\\perp:\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{coatom}(a),\\quad\n\\operatorname{coatom}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{atom}(a),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{coatom}(a),\\quad\n\\operatorname{coatom}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{atom}(a),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tt}^\\perp=\\operatorname{ff},\\quad\n\\operatorname{ff}^\\perp=\\operatorname{tt},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tt}^\\perp=\\operatorname{ff},\\quad\n\\operatorname{ff}^\\perp=\\operatorname{tt},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(R,S)^\\perp=\\operatorname{or}(R^\\perp,S^\\perp),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}(R,S)^\\perp=\\operatorname{or}(R^\\perp,S^\\perp),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(R,S)^\\perp=\\operatorname{and}(R^\\perp,S^\\perp).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{or}(R,S)^\\perp=\\operatorname{and}(R^\\perp,S^\\perp).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自由原子函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atom}(a))=\\{a\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atom}(a))=\\{a\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{coatom}(a))=\\{a\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{coatom}(a))=\\{a\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{tt})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{tt})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ff})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ff})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(R,S))=\\operatorname{FV}(R)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(S),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(R,S))=\\operatorname{FV}(R)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(S),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(R,S))=\\operatorname{FV}(R)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(R,S))=\\operatorname{FV}(R)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义结构替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\)</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(R,\\sigma)=R[\\sigma]\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}(R,\\sigma)=R[\\sigma]\\)</span>，并令：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(a)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(a),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}(a)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(a),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{coatom}(a)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(a)^\\perp,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{coatom}(a)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(a)^\\perp,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tt}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{tt},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tt}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{tt},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ff}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ff},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ff}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ff},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(R,S)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(R[\\sigma],S[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}(R,S)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(R[\\sigma],S[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(R,S)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(R[\\sigma],S[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{or}(R,S)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(R[\\sigma],S[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该结构语言没有绑定构造子。定义有限原子集、绑定名函数与新原子选择函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(R)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(R)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}:\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}(R,\\rho)=R[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atom}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}:\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}(R,\\rho)=R[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atom}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为句法相等：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{SKS}}S\\Longleftrightarrow R=S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{SKS}}S\\Longleftrightarrow R=S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-结构同余与深上下文\">3. 结构同余与深上下文</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有满足下列条件的二元关系的交集：它是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\)</span> 上的等价关系；它与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}\\)</span> 相容；并含有下列方程：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(R,S)\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\operatorname{and}(S,R),\\quad\n\\operatorname{or}(R,S)\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\operatorname{or}(S,R),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}(R,S)\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\operatorname{and}(S,R),\\quad\n\\operatorname{or}(R,S)\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\operatorname{or}(S,R),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{and}(R,S),T)\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\operatorname{and}(R,\\operatorname{and}(S,T)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{and}(R,S),T)\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\operatorname{and}(R,\\operatorname{and}(S,T)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{or}(R,S),T)\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\operatorname{or}(R,\\operatorname{or}(S,T)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{or}(R,S),T)\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\operatorname{or}(R,\\operatorname{or}(S,T)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(R,\\operatorname{tt})\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}R,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{or}(R,\\operatorname{ff})\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}(R,\\operatorname{tt})\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}R,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{or}(R,\\operatorname{ff})\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Box\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(C,R)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(C,R)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(C,R)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(C,R)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>填充函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}:\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}:\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\Box,R)=R,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\Box,R)=R,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{and}(C,T),R)=\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{plug}(C,R),T),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{and}(C,T),R)=\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{plug}(C,R),T),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{and}(T,C),R)=\\operatorname{and}(T,\\operatorname{plug}(C,R)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{and}(T,C),R)=\\operatorname{and}(T,\\operatorname{plug}(C,R)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{or}(C,T),R)=\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{plug}(C,R),T),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{or}(C,T),R)=\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{plug}(C,R),T),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{or}(T,C),R)=\\operatorname{or}(T,\\operatorname{plug}(C,R)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{or}(T,C),R)=\\operatorname{or}(T,\\operatorname{plug}(C,R)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-深推理规则\">4. 深推理规则</h1>\n<p>以下深推理规则均是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的子集。</p>\n<p>定义原子规则关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ai}\\downarrow}=\n\\{(\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{tt}),\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{atom}(a),\\operatorname{coatom}(a)))):C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},a\\in\\mathsf{At}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ai}\\downarrow}=\n\\{(\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{tt}),\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{atom}(a),\\operatorname{coatom}(a)))):C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},a\\in\\mathsf{At}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ai}\\uparrow}=\n\\{(\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{atom}(a),\\operatorname{coatom}(a))),\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{ff})):C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},a\\in\\mathsf{At}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ai}\\uparrow}=\n\\{(\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{atom}(a),\\operatorname{coatom}(a))),\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{ff})):C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},a\\in\\mathsf{At}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义结构规则关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{s}=\n\\{(\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{and}(R,S),T)),\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{and}(R,\\operatorname{or}(S,T)))):C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R,S,T\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{s}=\n\\{(\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{and}(R,S),T)),\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{and}(R,\\operatorname{or}(S,T)))):C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R,S,T\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{m}=\n\\{(\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{or}(R,S),\\operatorname{or}(T,U))),\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{and}(R,T),\\operatorname{and}(S,U)))):C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R,S,T,U\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{m}=\n\\{(\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{or}(R,S),\\operatorname{or}(T,U))),\\operatorname{plug}(C,\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{and}(R,T),\\operatorname{and}(S,U)))):C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R,S,T,U\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>同余步为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\equiv}=\\{(R,S):R,S\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\equiv}=\\{(R,S):R,S\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},R\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}}S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ai}\\downarrow}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ai}\\uparrow}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{s}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{m}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\equiv}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ai}\\downarrow}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ai}\\uparrow}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{s}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{m}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\equiv}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.1-初始结构公理集合\">4.1 初始结构公理集合</h1>\n<p>SKS 的零前提初始结构集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}=\\{\\operatorname{tt}\\}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}=\\{\\operatorname{tt}\\}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它只声明可作为定理性起点的结构；所有非零前提变化仍由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\)</span> 给出。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-有限推导\">5. 有限推导</h1>\n<p>定义结构列载体及推导函数的型别：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}^n,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}^n,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}:\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{()\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}:\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{()\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\">\\(R,S\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}(R,S)\n=\\left\\{\\pi:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\pi:n\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\land\\pi(0)=R\\land\\pi(n-1)=S\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall i&lt;n-1\\;(\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}(R,S)\n=\\left\\{\\pi:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\pi:n\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\land\\pi(0)=R\\land\\pi(n-1)=S\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall i&lt;n-1\\;(\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(R_0,\\ldots,R_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(R_0,\\ldots,R_{n-1})\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i=\\pi(i)\">\\(R_i=\\pi(i)\\)</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1\">\\(n=1\\)</span> 时没有相邻规则步骤，但唯一元素仍必须属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=S\">\\(R=S\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-可达性\">6. 可达性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R\\Rightarrow_{\\mathsf{SKS}}S\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R\\Rightarrow_{\\mathsf{SKS}}S\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}(R,S)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}(R,S)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-定理结构\">7. 定理结构</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{SKS}}S\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{\\mathsf{SKS}}S\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tt}\\Rightarrow_{\\mathsf{SKS}}S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tt}\\Rightarrow_{\\mathsf{SKS}}S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限推导证书集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}(R,S)=\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}(R,S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}(R,S)=\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}(R,S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>外部语义载体与语义反例对象显式为空：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}^{\\mathsf{sem}}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cex}^{\\mathsf{sem}}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Str}^{\\mathsf{sem}}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cex}^{\\mathsf{sem}}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{SKS}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},(-)^\\perp,\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\operatorname{plug},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\mathsf{Str}^{\\mathsf{sem}}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\mathsf{Cex}^{\\mathsf{sem}}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\Rightarrow_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{SKS}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{SKS}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},(-)^\\perp,\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\equiv_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\operatorname{plug},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\mathsf{Str}^{\\mathsf{sem}}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\mathsf{Cex}^{\\mathsf{sem}}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\Rightarrow_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{SKS}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义 SKS 深推理结构、上下文重写规则和有限推导；外部语义载体和语义反例对象均为空，不含语义真值、证明网或切消定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"916-Deep-Inference-SKS","text":"916 Deep Inference SKS","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-结构、对偶、自由原子与替换","text":"2. 结构、对偶、自由原子与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-结构同余与深上下文","text":"3. 结构同余与深上下文","level":1},{"id":"4.-深推理规则","text":"4. 深推理规则","level":1},{"id":"4.1-初始结构公理集合","text":"4.1 初始结构公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-有限推导","text":"5. 有限推导","level":1},{"id":"6.-可达性","text":"6. 可达性","level":1},{"id":"7.-定理结构","text":"7. 定理结构","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}=\\{a_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{coatom},\\operatorname{tt},\\operatorname{ff},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{coatom},\\operatorname{tt},\\operatorname{ff},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{coatom}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tt},\\operatorname{ff}\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atom}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},","display":true},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{coatom}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tt}\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ff}\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},","display":true},{"tex":"R,S\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(R,S)\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}},","display":true},{"tex":"R,S\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(R,S)\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}.","display":true},{"tex":"(-)^\\perp:\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\to\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{coatom}(a),\\quad\n\\operatorname{coatom}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{atom}(a),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tt}^\\perp=\\operatorname{ff},\\quad\n\\operatorname{ff}^\\perp=\\operatorname{tt},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and}(R,S)^\\perp=\\operatorname{or}(R^\\perp,S^\\perp),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{or}(R,S)^\\perp=\\operatorname{and}(R^\\perp,S^\\perp).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At}),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atom}(a))=\\{a\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{coatom}(a))=\\{a\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{tt})=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ff})=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(R,S))=\\operatorname{FV}(R)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(S),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(R,S))=\\operatorname{FV}(R)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}\\times\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{SKS}}^{\\mathsf{At}